# Knowledge base

`knowledge/` is canonical. `.cursor/rules/` only encodes hard engineering constraints.

Before changing combat, items, director, loop, or stack, read `knowledge/README.md` and the matching file.

If a task changes design, update the knowledge file in the same change. Do not leave chat-only decisions.

Do not add systems that violate `knowledge/design/anti-idle.md`.
